  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>All weapons are one in your hands, and each functions in your hands with masterful skill.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Martial Mastery<sup>ARG</sup>.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use all combat feats that apply to a specific weapon (such as Weapon Focus) with any weapon in any weapon group in which you have weapon training.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you are a gunslinger with the gun training class feature (or equivalent substitute feature), you can use all combat feats that apply to a specific firearm (such as Improved Critical) with any firearm.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc220\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
